貴的餐廳，結果看了菜單，意外平價！\n這次兩人點了鮭魚丼飯、唐揚雞、玉子燒、豆皮壽司，每個都很好吃！\n鮭魚丼飯的生魚片都有一定厚度！份量也很足夠，剛開始看起來小小一份，但實際超有飽足感，我們吃很飽、很滿足😌\n唐揚雞的皮也很薄，很有肉汁；玉子燒跟豆皮壽司中規中矩，我都很喜歡，份量剛剛好！\n\n最後又加點兩個布丁，一個才25，真的很好吃😋\nCP值很高，未來會持續想吃的店，下次想來吃拉麵！\n\n然後店員們隨時都會很細心的注意到客人，我覺得很棒！\n\n補留：看了留言，原來不是新開的店！整體環境超乾淨！",null,[0,128]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/8128215387388975742/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVDTWs0elJqSmxSVW8wVmxVd00xWnFXbkZpVnpWSlpXMU9SVkl3UlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,1123,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CMk4zRjJlRUo0VlUwM1ZqWnFiVzVJZW1ORVIwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xae7b691578df9f2d!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnB2N3F2eEJ4VU03VjZqbW5IemNER0E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CMk4zRjJlRUo0VlUwM1ZqWnFiVzVJZW1ORVIwRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CMk4zRjJlRUo0VlUwM1ZqWnFiVzVJZW1ORVIwRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25CMk4zRjJlRUo0VlUwM1ZqWnFiVzVJZW1OR